The GB10 inspection shows a running deployment, but the runbook still marks it “NOT built.” The files also show LAN-facing SSH paths outside Cloudflare and no enforced cutoff for GPU use between benchmark windows. I’m checking whether Docker’s internal network also permits access to host services.
